1
00:02:30,039 --> 00:02:35,499
This is the time known as the Great Pirate Era.

2
00:02:35,819 --> 00:02:39,819
A countless array of pirates go to battle across the seas in search of the One Piece,

3
00:02:40,059 --> 00:02:44,019
the legendary treasure left behind by Gold Roger, King of the Pirates.

4
00:02:44,619 --> 00:02:48,899
Mocky D. Luffy, a boy whose body turned to rubber after eating the gum gum fruit,

5
00:02:49,159 --> 00:02:51,639
set sail to become the next King of the Pirates.

6
00:02:52,019 --> 00:02:54,599
As Luffy and his crew conquer numerous obstacles,

7
00:02:54,919 --> 00:02:57,759
they capture the unwanted attention of the world government,

8
00:02:57,759 --> 00:03:00,799
which will use any means necessary to stop them.

9
00:03:02,119 --> 00:03:03,519
This sight!

10
00:03:04,619 --> 00:03:07,379
Can't wait to see what kind of adventure's up next!

11
00:03:08,139 --> 00:03:11,159
With a charted course awash in danger and intrigue,

12
00:03:11,379 --> 00:03:15,439
the crew will come a path across the Grand Line to the New World.

13
00:03:19,379 --> 00:03:23,259
After being separated from Mr. Three and Buggy in this starvation hell,

14
00:03:23,659 --> 00:03:26,999
Luffy and Bon Clay continued to fight their way to the lower levels,

