269
00:15:32,239 --> 00:15:37,179
Well, sir, the demon guard Minotaurus also fell into the well, and apparently he's not moving.

270
00:15:37,179 --> 00:15:39,339
Impossible! They defeated him?

271
00:15:42,199 --> 00:15:43,539
It appears so.

272
00:15:43,539 --> 00:15:46,679
The poor baby! I won't believe it!

273
00:15:47,679 --> 00:15:48,719
Pull it together!

274
00:15:52,499 --> 00:15:54,519
You will follow my orders carefully.

275
00:15:55,219 --> 00:15:58,719
There are only two ways to get out of level four that don't include dying.

276
00:15:58,859 --> 00:16:02,759
We have two staircases they can take that aren't currently protected by security guards.

277
00:16:03,819 --> 00:16:06,959
From this point forward, we're splitting our forces into three.

278
00:16:06,959 --> 00:16:12,459
Hanyabal, I want you in charge of this stairwell. Block all access to level three.

279
00:16:12,939 --> 00:16:17,339
Mistress Sadie, I want you and the demon guards to defend the stairwell leading to level five.

280
00:16:18,059 --> 00:16:25,799
No way! That sounds so boring. I want to punish those bad boys. Surely my outfit makes that clear enough to you.

281
00:16:25,799 --> 00:16:28,939
Maybe I'll just let them slip past me and have the warden take the blame.

282
00:16:28,939 --> 00:16:30,939
Any objections?

283
00:16:30,939 --> 00:16:36,779
Oh, please, Warden. Don't do that.

284
00:16:36,779 --> 00:16:39,179
But I didn't complain this time.

285
00:16:39,179 --> 00:16:41,939
You don't need to. I can sense you plotting against me.

286
00:16:41,939 --> 00:16:46,979
Oh, and once they're captured, you're free to do as you wish with them.

287
00:16:47,619 --> 00:16:51,759
Oh, yes, sir. I can get behind that idea.

288
00:16:51,899 --> 00:16:55,539
And as for the rest of the guards, I want you to pursue them at all costs.

289
00:16:55,899 --> 00:16:57,899
You bring them to me dead or alive.

290
00:16:58,239 --> 00:16:58,679
Sir!

291
00:16:59,559 --> 00:17:01,919
Almost dead works, too.

292
00:17:02,039 --> 00:17:04,959
This ends right now. They have toyed with me long enough.

293
00:17:04,959 --> 00:17:07,039
We have a reputation to uphold.

294
00:17:07,259 --> 00:17:09,839
The burning heat hell shall be their last stop.

295
00:17:11,939 --> 00:17:14,299
But first...

296
00:17:14,299 --> 00:17:15,979
Thornton's about to unleash his power!

297
00:17:29,979 --> 00:17:31,639
You're dumping again?

298
00:17:32,579 --> 00:17:33,339
Dammit!

299
00:17:34,119 --> 00:17:36,519
The floor is insanely hot in here!

300
00:17:36,639 --> 00:17:39,479
It's so hot my lungs feel like they're full of fire!

301
00:17:39,479 --> 00:17:42,119
Now should we move them faster we get out of this place!

302
00:17:42,339 --> 00:17:43,579
Now which way should we go?

303
00:17:44,899 --> 00:17:46,519
You guys sound like babies.

304
00:17:46,859 --> 00:17:47,719
Wily babies!

305
00:17:48,139 --> 00:17:50,659
It's mind over matter. Just pretend the fire's your friend.

306
00:17:50,979 --> 00:17:53,039
Honestly, I can't really blame you, though.

307
00:17:53,319 --> 00:17:56,579
I do admit it's a little steamy in here, even compared to that desert.

308
00:17:57,059 --> 00:17:59,839
Actually, maybe more than just a little...

309
00:18:00,839 --> 00:18:03,599
My friend the fire might be turning on me.

310
00:18:03,599 --> 00:18:05,959
Oh, crap!

311
00:18:05,959 --> 00:18:09,639
Your blathering is worse than the damn heat!

312
00:18:12,639 --> 00:18:13,999
I know which way!

313
00:18:14,339 --> 00:18:15,419
Follow me!

314
00:18:15,579 --> 00:18:16,299
Hey!

315
00:18:16,539 --> 00:18:17,799
Where are you going?

316
00:18:18,439 --> 00:18:19,679
So hot!

317
00:18:20,099 --> 00:18:21,619
We're aware of that!

318
00:18:23,739 --> 00:18:24,339
Huh.

319
00:18:24,679 --> 00:18:27,059
Now where could our little straw boy be leading us?

320
00:18:27,059 --> 00:18:34,799
Of course, to the kitchen!

321
00:18:36,419 --> 00:18:38,279
Good, because I'm famished!

322
00:18:38,559 --> 00:18:40,419
Wait for me, old chum!

323
00:18:41,319 --> 00:18:43,759
I'm not gonna lie, food does sound good!

324
00:18:43,839 --> 00:18:45,419
Kinda hoping for some food, too!

325
00:18:45,419 --> 00:18:46,959
No! Wait a minute, buggy!

326
00:18:49,759 --> 00:18:51,619
Hot, hot, hot, hot, hot, hot, hot!

327
00:18:51,699 --> 00:18:53,359
That food smells so good!

328
00:18:53,479 --> 00:18:54,479
Hot, hot, hot, hot!

329
00:18:54,559 --> 00:18:56,699
Oh, boy, I can't wait for Yanni food's eyes!

330
00:18:56,699 --> 00:18:58,199
It's a straw hat movie!

331
00:19:01,119 --> 00:19:02,759
Dang, there's a bunch of them!

332
00:19:03,939 --> 00:19:05,999
Oh, this heat's beating me down!

333
00:19:06,719 --> 00:19:09,579
But I'll get my energy back once I get some food in me!

334
00:19:09,679 --> 00:19:10,619
Stop right there!

335
00:19:16,059 --> 00:19:17,139
Kum-kum!

336
00:19:23,139 --> 00:19:23,619
Firewall!

337
00:19:26,699 --> 00:19:33,499
We have found straw hat Luffy, sir!

338
00:19:33,619 --> 00:19:35,379
Team A's locked in battle with him now!

339
00:19:36,999 --> 00:19:38,719
Team B has just arrived, too!

340
00:19:38,839 --> 00:19:41,459
They've joined up with Team A, and they're closing in on him!

341
00:19:41,719 --> 00:19:43,759
They don't seem to be holding up too well, though!

342
00:19:45,119 --> 00:19:46,959
Both teams are requesting the same backup, sir!

343
00:19:47,119 --> 00:19:47,879
What should we do?

344
00:19:47,879 --> 00:19:48,379
Hmm?

345
00:19:51,979 --> 00:19:52,059
Kum-kum!

346
00:19:52,199 --> 00:19:52,799
Woo-hoo!

347
00:19:52,879 --> 00:19:52,939
Wooah!

348
00:19:54,779 --> 00:19:55,019
Oh!

349
00:19:57,179 --> 00:19:57,899
AROUND AND AROUND AND AROUND I GO!

350
00:19:57,899 --> 00:19:59,559
Around and around I go,

351
00:19:59,559 --> 00:20:01,239
I'll come my way, Kim Poe,

352
00:20:01,239 --> 00:20:03,239
Memoirs of a Summer's Day!

353
00:20:07,979 --> 00:20:10,079
A and B teams have been wiped out.

354
00:20:10,079 --> 00:20:12,619
C, D, and E have major losses.

355
00:20:12,619 --> 00:20:14,779
Extra Becca from upstairs won't cut it.

356
00:20:14,779 --> 00:20:16,459
They're too powerful for us.

357
00:20:16,459 --> 00:20:18,119
We can't hold the position.

358
00:20:24,119 --> 00:20:25,619
Oh, woe is me.

359
00:20:25,619 --> 00:20:28,459
If only I were Warden, I could fix this.

360
00:20:28,459 --> 00:20:29,999
Waaaaaahhh!

361
00:20:51,179 --> 00:20:53,339
What are you freaking out about, partner?

362
00:20:53,339 --> 00:20:55,079
Open your eyes and take a look.

363
00:20:55,079 --> 00:20:55,919
Meh.

364
00:20:55,919 --> 00:20:57,819
There's an ocean of guards down there.

365
00:20:57,819 --> 00:21:01,179
And think, this level is devoted to the agony of the prisoners,

366
00:21:01,179 --> 00:21:04,419
yet there's not a single guard manning the fire torture pit.

367
00:21:04,419 --> 00:21:06,419
Waaaaaah!

368
00:21:11,299 --> 00:21:12,459
Let's go!

369
00:21:12,459 --> 00:21:13,599
Get a move on!

370
00:21:13,599 --> 00:21:16,699
The first thing we should do is to check the staircases.

371
00:21:16,699 --> 00:21:18,939
I've got a feeling they ambushed us.

372
00:21:18,939 --> 00:21:22,079
With all these guards, they probably boxed us in on this level.

373
00:21:22,079 --> 00:21:25,419
What if they've been waiting on level four this whole time?

374
00:21:25,419 --> 00:21:27,179
That means they just want Straw Hat!

375
00:21:27,179 --> 00:21:29,419
We weren't even trying to come down here!

376
00:21:29,419 --> 00:21:34,419
Maybe not, but we are still trying to break out and they do know our names and faces.

377
00:21:34,419 --> 00:21:37,159
Still, there's something even more troubling.

378
00:21:37,159 --> 00:21:46,159
If they're sending this many guards after us, it's extremely likely they're also sending in the Impel Down All-Stars to put an end to this chaos.

379
00:21:46,159 --> 00:21:49,999
And I'm not just talking about the other three demon guards, either.

380
00:21:51,999 --> 00:21:57,499
Warden Magellan himself might make an appearance, and then we're dead, my friend.

381
00:22:01,499 --> 00:22:03,579
Get out of my way!

382
00:22:03,579 --> 00:22:05,579
Help!

383
00:22:05,579 --> 00:22:06,719
Just give up!

384
00:22:06,719 --> 00:22:09,719
Quit blocking the phone!

385
00:22:09,719 --> 00:22:10,979
Whoa!

386
00:22:10,979 --> 00:22:15,559
Rick me out!

387
00:22:15,559 --> 00:22:16,699
I thought it was a spear or something heading at me.

388
00:22:16,699 --> 00:22:20,159
What is that?

389
00:22:23,459 --> 00:22:24,859
Gross!

390
00:22:24,859 --> 00:22:28,239
Is it jelly or poop?

391
00:22:28,239 --> 00:22:29,699
Huh?

392
00:22:29,699 --> 00:22:32,199
Oh no, no!

393
00:22:32,279 --> 00:22:37,039
.

394
00:22:37,039 --> 00:22:43,119
It's time to put an end to your buffoonery once and for all, boy.

395
00:22:43,559 --> 00:22:44,559
Who are you?

396
00:22:46,799 --> 00:22:48,759
It's Magellan!

397
00:22:50,899 --> 00:22:54,779
I've got you now, you criminal scum!

398
00:22:54,779 --> 00:23:09,459
Magellan finally reveals himself and Luffy stands up to his fearsome Venom Venom power,

399
00:23:09,779 --> 00:23:13,799
even knowing that a single touch of the Warden's deadly poison could lead to his death.

400
00:23:14,279 --> 00:23:16,839
When Bon Clay cowers before the might of Magellan's Hydra,

401
00:23:17,159 --> 00:23:21,319
is it a show of weakness or is the situation truly hopeless after all?

402
00:23:21,319 --> 00:23:26,079
On the next, One Piece, Mighty Magellan, Bon Clay bugs out!

403
00:23:26,439 --> 00:23:28,239
I'm gonna be king of the pirates!

